  "id": "family-dynamics",
  "term": "family dynamics",
  "definition": "Family dynamics are the patterns within a family that shape how family members influence a child’s emotional and social experiences. In this context, they strongly affect children’s sense of belonging, emotion regulation, and how socially connected they feel in virtual interactions such as mobile gaming.",
